{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/783763-question-about-the-kickstarter","id":783763,"title":"Question about the Kickstarter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-10T17:03:30-08:00","id":783763,"title":"Question about the Kickstarter?","content":"So lets say all I want is the physical copy of the Beast: the Primordial book do I have to wait until it comes out and order it or can I become a backer and give a certain amount to get it? I ask because while I tried reading the kickstarter page it was so confusing that it flew over my head (plus I am really tired). Call me old fashion but I really like holding a hard copy in my hands.<br /> <br /> If you have any information on this that would be great. Thank you for your help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>&quot;A dark shape crawls out from your closet. At first it looks like it has a large zipper for a mouth, however as it gets closer you soon realize that it isn't a zipper at all but rows of sharp yellow teeth!&quot;</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7343-werescythe","name":"Werescythe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7343_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T17:23:26-08:00","id":783774,"title":"","content":"The beast ks ended months ago. When the book is released after approval it will be a pod. As for the ks the deluxe edition will not be out for some time and it's unlikely you will get a copy. Unless extras were printed and onyx path decides to sell them off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T17:33:27-08:00","id":783785,"title":"","content":"Well the Kickstarter is already done, so you can't really become a backer now. Just prefacing it that way on the odd chance that such a thing actually aids you. At this point you will need to wait until they start selling the books on drivethrurpg or something then you can buy the hard copy.<br /> <br /> If it helps you for making sense of future kickstarters there's usually a reward level that explicitly gives you the hard copy of the book. In the case of Beast it was $50, or you can back at some other level and then put the money down for it as an add-on. (Again $50 for Beast) Hope any of this helps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-10T19:06:24-08:00","id":783846,"title":"","content":"It's also worth noting:<br /> <br /> The Kickstarter campaigns are for the &quot;deluxe&quot; editions of the books. These are hard copies with various fancy/collector-oriented additions that don't directly impact the actual content (though KS is also used to raise funds to add extra content in various forms, which is usually free to backers in an electronic format). The text of the deluxe editions is the same as the premium/standard Print-on-Demand versions you can buy at DriveThruRPG (the premium/standard division on DTRPG is a matter of paper thickness, and of inks). The deluxe editions have things like special cover treatments (leatherette covers, embossing, etc.), attached ribbon bookmarks, page gilding, GM screens (DTRPG doesn't have a PoD for these yet, though you can get them in a digital format and print them for a screen that allows insert pages), and so on.<br /> <br /> So you're not missing out on any content when you miss a KS. You're missing out on fancy extras. You can get some savings off of PDFs, and if you want a deluxe copy that sits on your shelf, and a PoD copy for table use, the coupon for a lower cost PoD is nice, but not worth it if you only want on physical copy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}